 "finalMessage": "Fixed a bug in htmlparser2's Parser where chunks queued while paused were lost when `reset()` was called from a callback.\n\nRoot cause: in `Parser.write()` (src/Parser.ts), `writeIndex` was unconditionally incremented after `tokenizer.write(chunk)`. If the tokenizer's callback (e.g. `ontext`) called `parser.reset()`, reset cleared `buffers` and set `writeIndex = 0`, but the pending `writeIndex++` l"
